{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream is a casual adventure game with non-linear progression and a surreal style based on a poem where players guide Luna (the protagonist, a little girl) as she travels through the dream world seeking to recover the feeling of her lost father's embrace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dream world is a 2.5D semi-open world map with portals that transport Luna to 2D (hand-painted) mazes. The goal is to solve the puzzle of how to navigate by manipulating the physics of the environment (rotating it) to discover how to reach the dreamcatchers and find the fragments of the poem and Luna's memories of her father when he was alive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4030100?t=1762159226","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030100/bae432c4b7dfc663035378f0d0a4b6d1c7d232d4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762159226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030100/15298faf225a8f36953752f658b3895d762aaeb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762159226","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030100/15298faf225a8f36953752f658b3895d762aaeb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762159226","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream is a casual adventure game with non-linear progression and a surreal style based on a poem where players guide Luna (the protagonist, a little girl) as she travels through the dream world seeking to recover the feeling of her lost father's embrace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dream world is a 2.5D semi-open world map with portals that transport Luna to 2D (hand-painted) mazes. The goal is to solve the puzzle of how to naviga